[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_8yd11"]
script = ExtResource("3_ebyvh")
title = "Credits"
description = "[b]CircleRC[/b]

A game by SpeedyVelcro

Made using the Godot Engine

[b]Art[/b]
SpeedyVelcro

[b]Sound Design[/b]
SpeedyVelcro

CircleRC uses third-party audio assets by the following creators:

InspectorJ (www.jshaw.co.uk)
Quistard (https://freesound.org/people/Quistard/)
Kenney (kenney.nl)

Specific audio assets and their license terms are enumerated in the about menu.

[b]Fonts[/b]
CircleRC uses the following third-party fonts:

Press Start 2P
By The Press Start 2P Project Authors (cody@zone38.net)

In addition to fonts included with the Godot Engine.

Font licenses can be found in the About menu."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bjgnxatvg3ldr"

